-price">2.5ct guide</a>.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>3ct marquise</strong></td><td>~$3,819 lab</td><td>~$54,687 natural</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/french-pave-diamond-engagement-ring-in-platinum-1-ct-tw-item-194406?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">French Pavé Platinum (1 ct.)</a></td><td>$3,925</td><td>$7,744</td><td>Statement tier. See <a href="/3-carat-marquise-diamond-price">3ct guide</a>.</td></tr></tbody></table>

